## Releasing

CI pushes `{{ .ImageName }}:<commit SHA>` on every push to main and prints its digest in the job summary. An environment runs only what its overlay pins; promote a build from `k8s/overlays/<env>`:

```sh
kustomize edit set image {{ .ImageName }}@sha256:<digest>
```

Until a digest is set the overlay's tag is `unset` and pods do not start.
